Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:03.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In an era in which the nations of \Nthe world were waging a fierce war
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:05.39,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,of information just out of sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:09.31,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,in order to keep an eye on one of the \Nkey players of the Ostanian government,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.31,0:00:11.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Westalis put Operation Strix into motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:14.05,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The extremely skilled agent \Nconducting this mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.11,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Agent Twilight, had completed Phase 1:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.11,0:00:21.10,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,creating a pretend family and getting his \Ndaughter into a prestigious school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:26.00,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Currently, his daughter has \Nsuccessfully obtained one Stella
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.67,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,out of the eight necessary to \Nbecome an Imperial Scholar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.50,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the mission has moved into Phase 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:36.69,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,attending the social gathering that \Nhis target, Desmond, will attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.47,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.56,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:47.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:50.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:53.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:56.57,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.62,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.62,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:08.38,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:15.30,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:22.18,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.18,0:01:28.10,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:34.11,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:40.37,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:48.50,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:02:00.68,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
