Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.31,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Your next social studies \Nassignment will be to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:20.06,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,research an occupation that \Nyou are interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:26.57,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You may visit your parents' places of work \Nor go interview local shops or companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:30.12,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You may even interview famous people \Nthrough your parents' connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:34.75,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Of course, if you'd like to know more about \Neducators, you may interview me, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.76,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I will gladly tell you about \Nour hallowed profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:42.35,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Compile your findings in a report. \NYou will be presenting it on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:44.90,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Will you be interviewing \Nyour father, Lord Damian?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.39,0:02:46.62,main,Damian,0,0,0,,If I can talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:51.17,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just make it \Nquick and ask my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.01,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What about you, Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:02:59.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A job investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:05.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I was told to ask why you chose your \Njob or how I can get into that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And I'm supposed to watch \Nyou do your job, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? My job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:14.37,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Wh-What should I tell her? My profession?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:15.54,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please listen carefully, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I will now show you the \Nways of my profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:21.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:27.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,At first, I started this job so that \NI could take care of my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but now, I'm very proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:34.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Even the Shopkeeper was saying that this \Nprofession was similar to being in the army,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:37.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,and it is very important because \Nwe lay down our lives for our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:40.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, the Shopkeeper is \Ncalling with my next job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:44.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So this person must be my client.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He is truly a traitorous pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:51.58,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It seems he's done many horrific things \Nthat I couldn't possibly tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Well, let's start this observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Can you keep up, Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:57.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:03.05,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,The Shop will let me know how many enemies \Nthere are and how the security is laid out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:04.93,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,so all I have to do is get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.23,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I will usually kill any enemy on sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.92,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,but I must not ever kill the wrong person,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:11.93,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,so studying the briefing \Ndocuments carefully is a must.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.01,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,There's nothing shameful about \Nthis work, so I can be confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:16.78,main,Man in black suit,0,0,0,,An intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.92,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I think what makes this job worthwhile
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:22.11,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,is that I truly feel like I'm cleaning \Nup the filth in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:26.60,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,When I think about all the lives \Nthat are being protected by my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:28.46,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I feel extra strength \Nflowing into every strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:33.11,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What's essential in this job is honing my \Nbody and my techniques to their limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.11,0:04:36.32,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Also, it's important to study human anatomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Since I'm dealing with other humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:41.82,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,the least I can do is put them out of \Ntheir misery as painlessly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:43.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I do beg your pardon, \Nbut I will be taking your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:50.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,For example, if you ■■■■■ \Nthe ■■■■■ of someone's neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,they will die rather quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:57.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You could also precisely attack one's \Nvital points like their brain or heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.20,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Miss Anya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:04.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1500)}Let's just tell Loid that we \Nwent to the tomato festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:10.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to investigate Papa's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:13.30,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I see... That's probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:17.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Working at city hall is a fine job, \Nbut it might be rather boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:22.30,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Blah, blah, yadda, yadda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:28.76,sign_8129_90_3_Days_Later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(570,43)\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H7D&\blur1\fad(523,1)}2\NDays\NLater,\Nat\NBerlint\NGeneral\NHospital
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:28.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The psychiatry department at \Nthis hospital is my workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:33.25,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I've told them in advance that you're \Ncoming, but don't trouble anyone, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:34.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:36.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is the longest-established \Nhospital in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:43.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It probably would've been easier to \Nfake being a general practitioner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:47.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but many prominent names from the political \Nand business world frequent this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:51.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This lets me infiltrate their social circles\N and steal plenty of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:56.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I haven't said anything you'd \Nneed to take notes about yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:58.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,By the way, why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:01.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is classic investigation fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:02.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Most psychiatrists don't wear lab coats,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:15.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,but this probably makes \Nme look the part more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:18.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So, what are you investigating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:23.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,First, why did you choose this job?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:25.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why I chose this job?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:31.31,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Everyone gets a cold sometimes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:33.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But it's not just the body. \NThe mind can go through that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:38.40,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people who \Ncatch colds, but in their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:43.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But Second Son told me I wouldn't \Ncatch a cold because I'm stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:45.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see... Well, keep getting along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:50.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But anyway, I wanted to \Nhelp people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:56.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There are still lots of veterans who are still \Nsuffering even years after the war ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:03.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Since Desmond is such a recluse, \NI figured that if I'm lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:07.44,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,being a doctor might give me a chance \Nto approach him if he ever got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.77,0:07:10.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I made up my mind when I was in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:14.99,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Um, the next question is, "What's the \Natomsphere like at your workplace?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:16.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You mean "atmosphere."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.49,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Oh, Dr. Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:21.61,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Is this your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,These are my colleagues. Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:27.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It is a pweasure to meet \Nyour acquiantenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.91,main,Female doctor E,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.91,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,You're doing your homework? \NWhat a good little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.89,main,Receptionist C,0,0,0,,Oh, her eyes are so big! \NShe looks like a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.13,main,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Have some snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:38.82,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,"Papa's workplace is paradise."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:39.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:43.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,What is Papa like at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:46.38,main,Receptionist C,0,0,0,,Oh, he does everything with such style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.95,main,Receptionist C,0,0,0,,He's so careful and kind \Nwith the patients, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:51.67,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,Your father's amazing, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:55.23,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,He became an important part of our \Nteam as soon as he transferred in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:58.62,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,But despite that, he's so down to \Nearth and respected by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:04.33,main,Female Doctor E,0,0,0,,By the way, my neurologist friend was hoping \Nyou'd come to our next meeting, Dr. Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.31,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,The director also wanted \Nyou to come golfing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:07.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:11.29,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well... I make sure to be sociable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.50,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll talk to the director...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:15.02,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's always good to spread \Nout my connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:17.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It makes it easier to obtain \Nintel and more connections,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.65,0:08:20.76,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and most importantly for a spy, it makes \Npeople think, "What? No way {\i0}he's{\i1} a spy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's crucial to completely embody how \NI want people to view this individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:26.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to try not to stand out \Ntoo much, but remain sociable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:29.28,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,"What? No way..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:32.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why in the world do you keep taking \Nnotes at the most random times?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:36.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,"What is hard about this job?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:37.98,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,That's a great question, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:43.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'd say it's the fact that we deal with \Npeople's hearts, which we can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Doctors aren't wizards, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We can't read other people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:49.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:51.29,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why do you look so smug?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:55.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Because we can't read minds, we have \Nto throw away our preconceptions,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:58.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and observe them assiduously and carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.55,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Just like a spy dealing with their target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:05.04,top,Loid external,0,0,0,,The most important thing is to \Nbuild trust with your patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:04.09,italics,Loid internal,0,0,0,,The biggest difference \Nwould be the fact that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:07.18,italics,Loid internal,0,0,0,,in the end, spies betray that trust, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.20,top,Loid external,0,0,0,,Everything is very delicate \Nand involves risks, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mm, snacks. Yum, yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.14,main,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Ooh, would you like some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:12.41,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,Want some juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:14.03,main,Female Doctor E,0,0,0,,Want to take a psychological test?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:15.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Never mind. I'm not answering any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:17.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, you're so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.74,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,But that's what makes him so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:23.94,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,We're hoping he continues to hone his skills \Nso he can open his own clinic someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:27.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,My apologies, but I've just \Nbeen so busy with my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:32.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess the hardest part is dealing \Nwith my mission and my side job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.99,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,Well, we should get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.70,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Bye now, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:39.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want to actually see you in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You want to see a consultation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:44.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't allow that. \NIt violates the patient's privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:47.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't show much of my \Nresearch to outsiders, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess I can at least show \Nyou the consultation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:55.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't plan on using \Nthis room today anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:57.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's different from the operatering room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:59.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It looks like a normal room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.07,0:10:01.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We try to make sure our \Npatients don't feel anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Where's the brain modification machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:07.64,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What exactly do you think I practice here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:11.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Enough of that nonsense. \NLet's finish the other questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.76,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Seriously, what cartoon did you get that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:16.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's done now. Also bored now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:18.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go touching \Nthings without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you fuss too much, I'm going to get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.27,0:10:22.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's a secret escape passage
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:25.31,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,behind this bookshelf just in case there's \Nan emergency related to the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:27.26,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It'll open up if you turn the lever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:29.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Secret passage! Lever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:33.91,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Must be a WISE agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:36.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sorry, something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:39.31,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you're done with your assignment, \Nshould we have Yor come pick you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:43.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I will wait until you're \Ndone with work, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.35,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Being a spy is rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:49.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. In that case, you can \Nkeep yourself busy with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We use this in our practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:56.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We have our patients place these toys \Nand props the way they want in these boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:10:57.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:59.25,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That seems boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:02.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Just a reminder, do not touch anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:03.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:05.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll be back in about ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:20.08,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,We should be getting documents on \Nthe revised DSM by the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:23.62,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Of course, to go with the rest of the façade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:27.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,a number of my coworkers have \Nalso infiltrated this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Another separate mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What about the adjustments \Nwith my hospital schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:32.79,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:35.97,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Was that little girl Anya Forger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.69,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,She seems quite attached to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:39.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She's unpredictable, so she's a real handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:44.05,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that she's beyond \Nwhat you expected, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:54.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Exploration is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Secret passage is so cramped...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:12:01.57,top,Doctor A,0,0,0,,Our discussion today will be on \Npsychic phenomena and neuroscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.49,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,A serious meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:07.46,main,Doctor A,0,0,0,,Around 5% of the cases reported \Nhave no explanation—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.17,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,Hmph, nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:12.59,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,Anyone who goes on about ghosts and \Nsuch just suffers from mythomania.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:16.08,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,Or they could be illusions \Ncaused by brain dysfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:18.30,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,This is all clearly unscientific.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:21.10,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,They're talking about ghosts? So exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.07,main,Doctor A,0,0,0,,Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.70,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,Er, there's no room above us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:32.36,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no! They'll find the secret passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.35,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,I-I'm sure it's just your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:40.48,main,Doctor A,0,0,0,,Anyway, as for treatment \Nin these situations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.49,main,Doctor A,0,0,0,,we should take a careful approach—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:45.86,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,There's no point in debating \Nthis. Let's end this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:50.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I have to get back. Papa will return soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.82,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,My leg is stuck and I can't get it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:58.01,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:07.01,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,What the?! There's something there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.60,main,Doctor D,0,0,0,,Is that a baby crying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:11.43,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,It's a ghost! It has to be a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.68,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I got it out! I have to hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:22.65,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,It's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.25,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.03,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,The rumors about a ghost of a baby
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:28.45,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,who died due to medical \Nmalpractice were true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.44,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,G-Gentlemen, let us continue this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:32.55,main,Doctor C,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:36.96,main,Doctor B,0,0,0,,From now on, let us take patients \Nwho speak of ghosts seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Whew...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:45.68,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Now, then... I wonder \Nhow her box turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.10,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:49.87,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I have to hurry up and make something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:53.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.59,0:13:56.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,P-Playing with dolls is so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:03.19,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You see, this gives us some insight into \Nthe deeper parts of a patient's psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.93,0:14:05.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It looks like your mind is full of...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:07.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,utter chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:12.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world is this? \NI've never seen anything like this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.90,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I just dumped everything in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:17.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are there so many \Nscattered and half-buried dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:23.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,They, um... They were all defeated by \Nthe bad guy's Rolling Sweep Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:27.59,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. I don't know what to make \Nof this, but it's clearly a disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:30.17,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I couldn't even see the signs \Nbecause I've been so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:33.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She was dragged out of the orphanage \Nby an adult she didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:36.12,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Of course she would be \Nunder a lot of stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:38.11,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Er, Papa, this is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:41.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure she did the best any child \Ncould do to endure it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:45.36,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But to think the darkness within \Nher heart had grown so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:48.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, maybe I just pretended not to notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:51.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, this is a result of my own weakness. \NI'm a failure as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:53.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I must do something immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:55.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why don't we go home for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:58.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's stop by a bookstore to get \Nyou the new volume of {\i1}Spy Wars{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:00.51,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Y-Yay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:03.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,After dinner, why don't we \Nput your report together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Did you take some good notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:06.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, that's—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.75,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,He'll see the spy stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.21,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't read any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is, uh... yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:21.11,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will do her best to \Nmake the report herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:25.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. Well, good girl. You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:27.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, we're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.57,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:33.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Did you get to see Loid's amazing \Nconcussive recovery method at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:34.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Concussive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:37.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, uh, Yor... That's just \Nfor extreme emergencies—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:39.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He punched and kicked his \Npatients with such might!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It was fantastic to witness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa's filled with violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:43.63,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:44.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:52.86,main,Male student A,0,0,0,,I realized that I also wanted \Nto carry on in this profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:53.48,main,Male student A,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:58.51,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,An elegant report that \Nconveyed your feelings well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:02.30,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Next, Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:08.72,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is a sp—spechulist in \Nmental health. A very good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:12.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa works very hard \Nevery day by not sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:16.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,or taking stomach medicine so that his \Npatients can have some peace of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:21.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He even said he wants to help people \Nwho had troubles during war times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.01,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, how wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:24.93,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Good show, Loid Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:30.96,main,Anya,0,0,0,,In order to build trust with his targets, \Nhe talks to them assisisisiduly and carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:31.83,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Targets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:34.82,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is very desperate to make conneshuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:38.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He golfs at his workplace \Nand creates shady channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:40.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, and they give you snacks there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:43.35,italics,Ewen,0,0,0,,Snacks?! Is that a codeword for bribes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:47.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, and he apparently hits his \Npatients every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:49.66,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Loid Forger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.76,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Twilight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.29,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, I just got a very bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:58.13,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Loid was summoned to the \Nschool a few days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:01.17,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,but he managed to smooth everything \Nover with his superb eloquence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:06.20,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,It says "top secret." Must be \Nanother top-secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:08.97,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,It's a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:11.05,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\move(322,165,322,0)\fs32\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\1a&H7D&\fsp5}SECRET CODE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:15.33,main,Bondman,0,0,0,,Saturday, 0800, come to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.22,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(260,165)\fscx65\fad(446,1)}DECIPHER THE PERPLEXING CODE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:25.74,italics,Mysterious Man (TV),0,0,0,,Well, you're definitely as elite as they say \Nyou are if you could decipher that code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's going to make a code, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:30.15,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And there she goes playing spy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:34.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:36.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Top secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:41.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No one's going to be able to read that, \Nlet alone crack the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:50.17,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Her handwriting is impossible to read, \Neven with my superb decoding skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:51.20,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:53.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to go in for my night shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Make sure you study.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:05.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It smells so nice and clean now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:07.68,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, I have a request, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:09.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What is it, Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:13.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Could you write something \Nfor me just like I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:21.45,sign_26325_339_SECRET_CODE_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnPapyrus}SECRET CODE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:24.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The code is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:30.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Listen well. This is a top-secret mission.\N Tell no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:31.63,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.62,main,Mailman,0,0,0,,I've got some mail for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:37.60,main,Mailman,0,0,0,,Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.97,main,Mail,0,0,0,,You need to put stamps on letters \Nand put them in the mailbox, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:45.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock! He rejected the code!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:47.20,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You mustn't do that, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:56.58,main,Neighbor 1,0,0,0,,Oh, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:01.19,main,Neighbor 2,0,0,0,,What strange text. Is it some kind of prank?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:05.24,main,Neighbor 3,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, my son \Nwrote something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:07.54,main,Neighbor 3,0,0,0,,He was copying some cartoon \Ncalled Spy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.51,main,Neighbor 1,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:12.81,main,Neighbor 2,0,0,0,,I guess that little girl is \Nalways pretending to be a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:17.23,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Heya. What're you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Scruffyhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:20.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Is Loid around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:28.61,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Man, so he's not home? Oh, well. \NI guess I'll come by again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.27,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What's this? A message from Loid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:37.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Tsk, tsk, tsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:39.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.61,0:19:48.64,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Good morning, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:54.30,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this? A letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.10,main,Becky,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.29,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! It's that quiz that \Neveryone's raving about lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:04.80,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.53,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Jeez... Anya, you meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:12.72,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Just tell me the answer already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:19.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Top secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:22.44,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:26.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh. It's a secret code. \NJust try and crack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:31.58,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Why the heck do I have to crack this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.71,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Crack it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:47.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's excited to see who shows up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:56.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You actually cracked the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:04.43,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, this is the thing from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:09.67,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I can see that it's some kind \Nof code, but what the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.19,0:21:14.29,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,This is nice handwriting... \NCould it be from a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.72,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,It does smell nice, like soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:22.12,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Could this be a love letter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:27.24,main,Beautiful woman,0,0,0,,Could you give this to him for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:28.88,main,Beautiful woman,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:32.53,main,Beautiful woman,0,0,0,,This is a top-secret romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:42.87,main,Franky,0,0,0,,"Saturday, 0800, come to the bridge."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:49.01,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Don't you dare try and underestimate the \Nbest informant in the East and the West!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:53.53,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Cracking a code or two is easy as pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:56.71,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Though I couldn't sleep a wink \Nbecause I was so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:59.28,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Man, that sun's bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:02.52,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,To think she'd call me \Nout here using a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:04.38,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,I wonder where this agent works.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:07.13,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Or wait, she could just be \Nobsessed with mysteries!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:12.00,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Like, "Crack the code of love\N and come see me"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.81,0:22:28.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Top secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:09.96,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,235)\fscx60}NIGHTFALL\NFIRST FIT OF JEALOUSY
